    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54eb8b0c9a8ad18b4d797cdb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这一天，我和神业来到了机场。\n听说杏目今后将去迪拜比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3072eafae7b7cf8c376a8924e1a69c611bb3468539418948b49ed51583648a43",
