    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7af014dae94d77f3d20c49cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不存在既定的剧本。\n神业让比赛无法预测的戏剧般的魅力\n――变得更加有意思",
      "source_fingerprint": "38aec52603336a1dda117b10b8121c7c5e207f1e525a13fdcaa850b99c6670cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60ddc92c76516a9326244436",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进而再次来到赛场，\n期待起下一场的戏剧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6d57065c25faf6b42fc9fcfe61b23d7098a810f60e385f74611766774a37405",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
